"This \"psychic powers\" stuff is easy, as long as nothing distracts you.  "
"When you are concentrating on 0 powers, or have 0 pain, you have an easier "
"time invoking your powers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
msgid "Concussive Blasts"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Concussive Blasts"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/mod_interactions/bombastic_perks/perks.json
