"Happy.  In Your Lane.  Focused.  Flourishing.  Your Intelligence is only "
"penalized 66% of the normal amount from pain, and 33% of normal if you're "
"using the Biokinetic power Overcome Pain, the Electrokinetic power Pain "
"Suppression, or the Telepathic power Mood Stabilization."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mutation name
