"Nether energy easily flows through you, causing your power to rise and fall "
"far faster than normal.  You gain far more Nether Attunement from channeling "
"or maintaining your powers, but you lose your Nether Attunement much faster "
"as well.  You do not lose Nether Attunement at this accelerated rate while "
"maintaining any powers."
