#. ~ Description of monster "enervating amalgamation"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/amalgamations.json
msgid ""
"An elongated body moving irregularly on five legs, with two flexible "
"tentacles waving in the air as it moves.  It seems to have no head, with a "
"ring of black spots on top that might be sensory organs.  Its skin is "
"perfectly smooth and greyish-white, without a single spot or blemish."
msgstr ""

