#. ~ Description of monster "fear hawk"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A hawk with striking golden eyes.  Its call seems to pierce deep into your "
"psyche even when it's not directed at you."
msgstr ""

