#. ~ Description of monster "cow"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  She is quite muscular, "
"and would be a great source of milk if domesticated or of meat and leather if"
" slaughtered.  This one moves with an oddly fluid grace."
msgstr ""

