#. ~ Description of monster "hodag"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This is very similar to a cow, though the bone spikes growing from its back "
"and its clawed feet separate it from any cow you've ever seen.  Despite its "
"fearsome armaments, it grazes placidly on grass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hodag"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "gremlin"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "feral dervish"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
