#. ~ Description of monster "baby hodag"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This is very similar to a calf, though the short bone spikes growing from its"
" back and its clawed feet separate it from any calf you've ever seen.  "
"Despite its fearsome armaments, it grazes placidly on grass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "cockatrice"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This strange mutant bird gains its name from its odd appearance.  Although "
"its features seem to be becoming more reptilian, it doesn't appear dangerous."
"  However, it looks at you like it understands you in some way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "cockatrice"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s stares and lets out a silent cry!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "strange chick"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A strange tiny chick, it could be from a number of different species if it "
"weren't for the patches of scales between its feathers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "pigeon passenger"
msgid_plural "pigeon passengers"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "pigeon passenger"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A gentle, plump, small-billed bird with a third eye, between its bill and "
"forehead.  On the ground, it struts about with a characteristic bobbing of "
"the head.  It is a strong, swift flier thanks to its long wings and powerful "
"flight muscles.  Is it following you?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "pigeon passenger"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$'s third eye opens and it coos!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_pigeon_passenger_chick"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"A tiny darkly-colored chick, it could be from a number of different species "
"if it weren't for the third eye below the center of its forehead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "gremlin"
msgid_plural "gremlins"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "gremlin"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"The red fox, an omnivorous canine and largest of the true foxes, it is a wily"
" hunter with a combative, suspicious temperament.  Sparks occasionally "
"crackle over its fur and its body distorts oddly as it moves, covering more "
"ground with each stride than the length of its legs would indicate."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "gremlin"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "Sparks flicker over %1$s's fur."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "direhound"
msgid_plural "direhounds"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "direhound"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This large canid has grown to terrifying proportions, roughly three times the"
" size of some of its brethren.  Its teeth give steak knives a run for their "
"money, and it looks to be the social center of any surrounding dogs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "direhound"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "The direhound gazes upon its allies, and lets out a howl!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "hellhound"
msgid_plural "hellhounds"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "hellhound"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"This once-average Labrador mixed-breed dog has clearly gone feral.  Though it"
" likely still instinctively trusts humans, it's probably far from domestic by"
" now.  The air around it wavers like the haze over summer asphalt."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "hellhound"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
#, c-format
msgid "%1$s barks out a stream of flame!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid "hellpup"
msgid_plural "hellpups"
msgstr[0] ""
msgstr[1] ""
msgstr[2] ""
msgstr[3] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "hellpup"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/animal_psychics.json
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog.  Its breath is very hot."
msgstr ""

