#. ~ Description of monster "mathematician A57"
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
msgid ""
"No one could mistake this person for a human; they move with astonishing "
"speed and grace, but every motion is precisely controlled.  As they catch "
"sight of you, a momentary grimace mars the perfection of their unnaturally "
"beautiful face, and as they move quickly toward you, they make a quick "
"gesture and some debris on the floor moves out of their way."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster attack message
#: data/mods/MindOverMatter/monsters/bosses.json
#, c-format
msgid "Mathematician A57 hits your %2$s with a pipe in a blur of motion!"
msgstr ""

